Defines chrome/common/phlink_adblock.mojom with a single
phlink.mojom.AdblockCosmeticFilter interface returning per-URL
cosmetic resources (hide_selectors, injected_script, generichide).

Adds phlink::adblock::CosmeticFilterHost — a stateless,
self-owned-receiver implementation registered per-frame in
PopulateChromeFrameBinders. It looks up the singleton
EngineProvider's Engine and forwards the GURL to
Engine::UrlCosmeticResources. Non-http(s) URLs short-circuit
to empty resources to avoid extension/chrome:// noise.

Build (autoninja chrome): SUCCESS. 10/10 unit tests still green.

Refs PRD §6.1, §10.1 (site isolation stays ON), plan 5-05b.
